        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "cd839e7f-884c-5379-8208-1d6127a6eaea",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Red Herring, GameFan, GameGO!, Rojo.com\n- People: Christopher J. Alden, Halverson, Eric C. Mylonas, Thomas Keller\n- Products: Red Herring magazine, online daily technology news service, technology newsletters, GameFan hybrid video game/film magazine, early web-based RSS reader\n- Topics: technology media, innovation publishing, gaming magazines, hardcore gaming market\n\nFacts:\n- Christopher J. Alden is an American entrepreneur best known as a co-founder of Red Herring and Rojo.com.\n- Red Herring is a media company that publishes an innovation magazine, an online daily technology news service, technology newsletters, and hosts events for technology leaders.\n- Rojo.com was an early web-based RSS reader.\n- GameGO! was conceived by Eric C. Mylonas and Thomas Keller.\n- GameGO! was staffed by former GameFan editors.\n- GameGO! intended to follow in the footsteps of the then-defunct GameFan Magazine while focusing more deeply on the hardcore gaming market.\n- In April 2010, Halverson relaunched GameFan as a hybrid video game and film magazine.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
